### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)

```turtle
@prefix ex: <http://example.org/driving-scene#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:egoVehicle a ex:Vehicle .
ex:soccerBall a ex:Obstacle .
ex:roadInfrastructure a ex:Infrastructure .

ex:soccerBall ex:isNear ex:egoVehicle .
ex:soccerBall ex:isMovingAcross ex:egoVehiclePath .
ex:egoVehicle ex:isTravelingBetween ex:brickWalls .
ex:brickWalls ex:occludes ex:potentialPedestrian .
```

